-- On the purposive reading of the leap-day pair (fork F-pair), two years from 2024-02-28: 2026-02-28 (Saturday).
#ASSERT `on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28) EQUALS (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT `extended to the next day that is not a holiday` `calendar G` (`on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28)) EQUALS (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT `with a holiday last day also excluded, once` `calendar G` (`on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28)) EQUALS (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT `extended to the next day that is not a holiday` `calendar C` (`on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28)) EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 2)
#ASSERT `with a holiday last day also excluded, once` `calendar C` (`on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28)) EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `extended to the next day that is not a holiday` `calendar C plus` (`on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28)) EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 2)
#ASSERT `with a holiday last day also excluded, once` `calendar C plus` (`on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28)) EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 1)

